# This repository IS a frozen release bundle: every product is covered by
# release_checksums.sha256. Line-ending normalisation would silently change the
# bytes of the text products (.tex, .txt, .json, .csv, .ini, .sql, .cff, .md)
# and make the shipped manifest fail on a fresh clone -- which is exactly what
# happened to v1.0.8, where 16 of its 22 checksum mismatches came from LF
# normalisation alone.
#
# Preserve bytes for everything. Do not reintroduce `text=auto` here.
* -text

# Belt and braces for the obvious binaries.
*.fits binary
*.npz  binary
*.pdf  binary
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.zip  binary
